  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDH-NICFI partnership program - Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will facilitate long-term systemic change in Par&#xe1; and Mato Grosso, aiming towards better incomes for farmers and communities, and a better environment through reduced deforestation and ecosystem loss. The program focuses on the supply chains of cattle and soy.</narrative>
  </description>
